# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# The openings module's part of the evaluation: opening types as recheck
# candidates, since a changed type changes the hosts that carry its openings.
import bim/bim_model.dl

function collect bim candidates of {bim model record:modelValue} with architectural_openings elements into {a pointer to a list:candidates}:
    execute:
        loop cursor from 0 to the length of (modelValue's openingTypes's values):
            append (the item at cursor in (modelValue's openingTypes's values))'s id to candidates
